<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we also compare the performance of LoCalPFN with other models using accuracy and F1 score as the metric. We can observe a similar pattern here: LoCalPFN either matches or outperforms other models on either of these metrics as well.</p>
